    "Generated catalogue is verified against the canonical data on every npm test and regenerated by release --refresh.",
    "Optional modules/styles load once, retain CSS cascade order and retry on failure.",
    "A render token prevents delayed feature loads from mounting after navigation.",
    "One view disposer replaces seven parallel cleanup slots.",
    "Ranked-only views skip tournament match, ban and detailed observation downloads; tournament-only views skip ranked partitions.",
    "A one-entry cache reuses tournament aggregation for search, sorting and side selection.",
    "Ranked partitions hydrate once per shared request; the cache retains hydrated objects without also retaining their source tuple arrays.",
    "Number formatting, query normalization and skill patterns are reused; typography avoids overlapping subtree walks.",
    "Validation-only URL checks were moved out of the browser module, a retired typography alias and obsolete feedback selector were removed.",
    "19 identical CSS declarations and two resulting empty rules were removed without changing the final cascade."
